<div class="section cmp-section--site-width-1248 cmp-section--remove-bottom-padding aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">

<div class="cmp-section " id="section-163a1231c3">


    <div class="cmp-section__container" data-background-image="false" data-dynamic-media-image="false" data-lazy-loaded="true">




<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">

    <div class="text cmp-text--site-width-824 cmp-text--align-left cmp-text--padding-48 cmp-text--remove-bottom-padding aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div class="cmp-text" id="text-2ef2ded39b">
    <h3>Featured Projects</h3>
<p>Every project tells a story of partnership and possibility. Across industries and regions, our customers turn to Mortenson for teams who understand their goals, their communities, and the complexities of their work. Whether advancing healthcare, higher education, civic life, or entertainment, these projects reflect what’s possible when the right expertise, collaboration, and vision come together to deliver lasting impact.</p>

</div>



</div>


</div>

    </div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="section cmp-section--remove-top-padding aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">

<div class="cmp-section " id="section-2da2519782">


    <div class="cmp-section__container" data-background-image="false" data-dynamic-media-image="false" data-lazy-loaded="true">




<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">

    <div class="carousel aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">

<section class="cmp-carousel cmp-carousel--autoplay play-enabled" id="carousel-31f5ecd2a2" role="group" aria-live="polite" aria-roledescription="carousel" data-cmp-is="carousel" data-cmp-autoplay="" data-cmp-delay="5000" data-cmp-number-of-slides="1" data-cmp-slides-per-group="1" data-cmp-a11y-label-slide="Slide {0}" data-placeholder-text="false">


     <div class="cmp-carousel__content swiper swiper-initialized swiper-horizontal swiper-pointer-events swiper-backface-hidden" aria-atomic="false" aria-live="off">

          <div class="cmp-carousel__slides swiper-wrapper" id="swiper-wrapper-e546ef3b1e162241" aria-live="off" style="cursor: grab; transform: translate3d(-2880px, 0px, 0px); transition-duration: 0ms;">
               <div class="cmp-carousel__item swiper-slide" id="carousel-slide-28550ec196" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" aria-label="1 / 6" data-cmp-hook-carousel="item" style="width: 1440px;"><div class="carousel-slide parbase">

<div class="cmp-carousel-slide" id="carousel-slide-28550ec196">

    <div class="cmp-carousel-slide__content">



<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">

    <div class="teaser cmp-teaser--type-card-overlay aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div class="cmp-teaser " id="teaser-3138be7d86">


        <div class="cmp-teaser__image">

    <div data-asset="/assets-f/img/3b9945aace508d.jpg" data-background-image="false" data-dynamic-media-image="false" data-lazy-loaded="true" data-src="/assets-f/img/39fedd1ddae938.jpg" data-title="Modern glass office building at sunset" data-widths="128,256,512,1024,1280,1440,1920,2048" id="image-e0473bc42b" class="cmp-image" itemscope="" itemtype="http://schema.org/ImageObject">

            <figure class="cmp-image__figure">
                <picture class="cmp-image__picture">
                    <img src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" width="2496" height="1664" class="cmp-image__image cmp-image__image--lazy-loading" itemprop="contentUrl" alt="Modern glass office building at sunset">
                </picture>

            </figure>


    </div>


        </div>



    <div class="cmp-teaser__content">

  <p class="cmp-teaser__eyebrowText eyebrow">
    Healthcare
  </p>
    <h4 class="cmp-teaser__title">
        UW Health Eastpark Medical Center
      </h4>


    <h4 class="cmp-teaser__subtitle">Madison, WI</h4>


    <div class="cmp-teaser__description"><p>UW Health Eastpark Medical Center leads the industry in patient care, comfort, and convenience. Partnering with the Carbone Cancer Center, this facility is one of the first in the U.S. to offer upright proton therapy, the most accurate and innovative form of radiation treatment.&nbsp;</p>
<p>The LEED-certified facility was designed with a coordinated care model in mind. With 40 types of specialty care and 250 clinical trials available, patients have unparalleled access to groundbreaking technologies and the specialized care they need, under one roof.</p>
</div>



    <div class="cmp-teaser__cta"><div class="cta button cmp-button--primary">

<a id="button-df2a14dea5" class="cmp-button  " href="#" target="_self">


    <span class="cmp-button__text">LEARN MORE</span>



</a>




</div>
</div>

    </div>
</div>



</div>


</div>

    </div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="cmp-carousel__item swiper-slide swiper-slide-prev" id="carousel-slide-ad5f082a1d" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" aria-label="2 / 6" data-cmp-hook-carousel="item" style="width: 1440px;"><div class="carousel-slide parbase">

<div class="cmp-carousel-slide" id="carousel-slide-ad5f082a1d">

    <div class="cmp-carousel-slide__content">



<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">

    <div class="teaser cmp-teaser--type-card-overlay aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div class="cmp-teaser " id="teaser-af1a8ce68d">


        <div class="cmp-teaser__image">

    <div data-asset="/assets-f/img/5aca8db777d01f.jpg" data-background-image="false" data-dynamic-media-image="false" data-lazy-loaded="true" data-src="/assets-f/img/d7cda2c14a9853.jpg" data-widths="128,256,512,1024,1280,1440,1920,2048" id="image-60b0c1d84e" class="cmp-image" itemscope="" itemtype="http://schema.org/ImageObject">

            <figure class="cmp-image__figure">
                <picture class="cmp-image__picture">
                    <img src="/assets-f/img/c8cbf565176206.jpg" width="2496" height="1664" class="cmp-image__image cmp-image__image--lazy-loading" itemprop="contentUrl" alt="">
                </picture>

            </figure>


    </div>


        </div>



    <div class="cmp-teaser__content">

  <p class="cmp-teaser__eyebrowText eyebrow">
    Higher Education
  </p>
    <h4 class="cmp-teaser__title">
        Washington University Kaiser Borsari Hall
      </h4>


    <h4 class="cmp-teaser__subtitle">Bellingham, WA</h4>


    <div class="cmp-teaser__description"><p>Setting new standards across the industry and the state of Washington, Western Washington University is delivering the state’s first publicly funded zero-energy academic building on a campus. Featuring mass timber, the state-of-the-art building offers a ‘living laboratory approach’ and biophilic design.&nbsp;</p>
<p>Mortenson partnered closely with Western Washington University to bring their vision to life, ensuring the facility met the International Living Future Institute’s Zero Carbon and Zero Energy Certification goals while staying within budget and maintaining the educational program space.</p>
</div>



    <div class="cmp-teaser__cta"><div class="cta button cmp-button--primary">

<a id="button-69bfd9b2d6" class="cmp-button  " href="#" target="_self">


    <span class="cmp-button__text">LEARN MORE</span>



</a>




</div>
</div>

    </div>
</div>



</div>


</div>

    </div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="cmp-carousel__item swiper-slide cmp-carousel__item--active" id="carousel-slide-87711d7f73" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-hidden="false" tabindex="0" aria-label="3 / 6" data-cmp-hook-carousel="item" style="width: 1440px;"><div class="carousel-slide parbase">

<div class="cmp-carousel-slide" id="carousel-slide-87711d7f73">

    <div class="cmp-carousel-slide__content">



<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">

    <div class="teaser cmp-teaser--type-card-overlay aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div class="cmp-teaser " id="teaser-f142cf3df8">


        <div class="cmp-teaser__image">

    <div data-asset="/assets-f/img/815b4617624dd8.jpg" data-background-image="false" data-dynamic-media-image="false" data-lazy-loaded="true" data-src="/assets-f/img/0d3bd25f1d960b.jpg" data-widths="128,256,512,1024,1280,1440,1920,2048" id="image-0653077128" class="cmp-image" itemscope="" itemtype="http://schema.org/ImageObject">

            <figure class="cmp-image__figure">
                <picture class="cmp-image__picture">
                    <img src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" width="2496" height="1664" class="cmp-image__image cmp-image__image--lazy-loading" itemprop="contentUrl" alt="">
                </picture>

            </figure>


    </div>


        </div>



    <div class="cmp-teaser__content">

  <p class="cmp-teaser__eyebrowText eyebrow">
    Office Spaces
  </p>
    <h4 class="cmp-teaser__title">
        The Beam on Farmer®
      </h4>


    <h4 class="cmp-teaser__subtitle">Tempe, AZ</h4>


    <div class="cmp-teaser__description"><p>The Beam on Farmer® is Arizona's first cross-laminated timber (CLT) office, developed and built by Mortenson. This 184,000-square-foot space sets a new workplace standard, providing a healthy, functional and sustainable work environment.</p>
<p>Using CLT reduced the building's carbon footprint by more than 10% in contrast to concrete structures. Additionally, CLT is a renewable resource; it only takes an estimated 15 minutes for U.S. and Canadian forests to grow the amount of wood used on the facility.</p>
</div>



    <div class="cmp-teaser__cta"><div class="cta button cmp-button--primary">

<a id="button-25fea0ef29" class="cmp-button  " href="#" target="_self">


