        </div>



    <div class="cmp-teaser__content">

  <p class="cmp-teaser__eyebrowText eyebrow">
    sports + entertainment
  </p>
    <h4 class="cmp-teaser__title">
        GEODIS Park
      </h4>


    <h4 class="cmp-teaser__subtitle">Nashville, TN</h4>


    <div class="cmp-teaser__description"><p>Home to Nashville SC, one of the latest expansion teams, GEODIS Park is the largest soccer-specific stadium in the US and Canada.&nbsp; Encompassing the true spirit of Nashville in its industrial aesthetics and function, the stadium blends in seamlessly with the surrounding Wedgewood-Houston area.</p>
<p>The venue was truly built FOR and BY the community, with over 75% local workforce participation and nearly $76 million awarded to diverse businesses. Reinvesting in our community and supporting minority- and women-owned businesses is essential</p>
</div>



